  "title": "Bank unions defer nationwide strike after IBA and UFBU form committee",
  "summary": "Bank unions have deferred a three-day nationwide strike following the formation of a committee by the Indian Banks’ Association and the Union for Financial Assistance (UFBU) to address the issue of declaring Saturdays as holidays.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "A high-level committee of the Indian Banks’ Association and UFBU will be formed immediately to deliberate on the issue of declaring the remaining Saturdays as bank holidays.",
      "confidence": 0.95
